nd hardscape, sleeves\n\u2022 Valve boxes, controllers, backflow and other equipment pins\n\u2022 Watering schedules from local weather (evapotranspiration), soil and grass type\n\u2022 PDF reports and project files to share\n\nControls: point and pull the trigger to tap. The thumbstick zooms and rotates the map, and on-screen buttons zoom, rotate and move it.\n\nPrivacy: no login, no ads, no tracking. Your projects are stored only on your headset in an encrypted database. Satellite maps, address search, weather and soil lookups need an internet connection.\n\n\u2022 All Pro features included: Inspection Mode, inspection reports, Work Order Estimates and your company branding. No in-app purchases.", "short_description": "Design and map sprinkler systems on a big virtual screen. Draw zones on satellite maps, place heads with real manufacturer nozzle data, check spray coverage and precipitation rates, route pipe, and build watering schedules, all in a resizable window. Made for irrigation contractors and serious DIYers. No account needed; your projects stay on your headset."}]}, "developer_name": "Levi Beaird", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/spraymap/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Levi Beaird", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/spraymap/home", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1063584910766706"}, {"id": "393222478507326"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH", "HAND_TRACKING"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING"], "supported_trackin